## Project Objectives

Development and commercialization of second-generation high-temperature superconductor (HTS) wire for power transmission, MRI systems, and fusion energy applications.

### Key Deliverables
1. YBCO-based HTS wire production
2. Manufacturing process optimization
3. 1 km continuous wire capability
4. Customer qualification
5. Production capacity: 500 km/year

