## Technical Specifications

| Property | Specification |
|-----------|---------------|
| Critical Current | 600 A/cm-width @ 77K |
| Critical Temperature | 92 K |
| Wire Width | 4 mm standard |
| Wire Thickness | 0.1 mm |
| Piece Length | 1,000 m minimum |
| Substrate | Hastelloy C276 |

### Performance Comparison

| Metric | Copper | HTS Wire | Advantage |
|--------|--------|----------|-----------|
| Current Density | 5 A/mm² | 500 A/mm² | 100x |
| AC Losses | High | Very Low | 90% reduction |
| Weight | 8.9 g/cm³ | 2.1 g/cm³ | 4x lighter |
| Efficiency | 94% | 99.9% | Near-lossless |

