## Manufacturing Process

| Step | Equipment | Vendor |
|------|-----------|--------|
| Substrate Preparation | Ion Beam Texturing | Intevac |
| Buffer Layer | Pulsed Laser Deposition | Coherent |
| YBCO Deposition | MOCVD | Veeco |
| Silver Cap | Sputtering | Applied Materials |
| Lamination | Roll-to-Roll | Custom |

